  "body": "## What's Changed\n\n### Bug Fixes\n* release-operator: OpenShift catalog PR fails for 3.3.x releases (published-bundle.sh missing from the tag) (#10584)\n* A review comment cancels the in-flight Verify suite and leaves the gate red (#10176)\n* bug(ui): Change version state dialog shows SUNSET as \"Unknown\" (#10175)\n* fix(ci): editing a comment to add /assign-me or /claim never triggers assignment (#10165)\n* GitOps poll failures are invisible in sync status: failed git fetch reports syncState=IDLE with an advanced lastSyncAttempt (#10154)\n* fix(ci): stale sweep closes PRs that are blocked on a maintainer (#10149)\n* bug(ui): disabled artifact version page fails with \"Resource not found\", making the version un-re-enablable from the console (#10126)\n* Flaky test: IngressITTest.ingressAnnotations times out on OCP 4.16 (#9276)\n\n### Enhancements\n* feat(cli): add gitops management commands (status, sync, validate) (#9934)\n\n### Other Changes\n* Track 3.3.x in post-merge verification (#10591)\n* Bring 3.3.x workflows up to date with main (#10583)\n* Version search with a structure filter returns 500 when the search index is disabled (#10489)\n* Replace logback-classic with slf4j-simple in perf test modules (#10353)\n* Version metadata limits (name/description/labels) are not enforced when creating a new artifact version (#10278)\n* OLM v1: ClusterExtension bundle install rejected by RBAC privilege-escalation check, breaking UpgradeOLMv1ITTest upgrade/channel-switch tests (#10276)\n* Downstream UI masthead test expects outdated Red Hat logo filename (#10257)\n* Kiota generator binary is downloaded on every CI job, and a GitHub outage fails the build (#10241)\n* UI Settings - Filter test fails with KafkaSQL storage: expects 15 properties, receives 16 (#10239)\n* Scalpel change detection: changes under non-Maven project roots force a full 57-module build (#10170)\n* OpenAPI DEREFERENCE does not resolve references to YAML artifacts due to incorrect content type handling (#10159)\n* Document current web console workflows (#10157)\n* feat(ci): restrict self-assignment of maintainer-only (area/CI) issues (#10137)\n* SearchedBranch loses groupId and artifactId in V3ApiUtil.dtoToSearchResults (#10135)\n* Flake: Text file busy executing the kiota binary during integration-tests (#10108)\n* kiota binary is downloaded once per module instead of once per build (#10107)\n* Document what the scalpel-report artifact actually measures, so the projected saving is not overstated (#10104)\n* docs(operator): document migration from removed app.sql / app.kafkasql to app.storage (#10100)\n* main Verify is failing more often than it passes: four unrelated CI flakes (#10085)\n* test(operator): fix K8sCell conflict detection and create failure handling (#10084)\n* External load validation produces trustworthy numbers but nothing compares them against a baseline (#10077)\n* ui: use generated SDK client instead of raw axios for artifact version content requests (#10069)\n* Operator's ConsolePlugin CR name collides across namespaces, letting one ApicurioRegistry3 overwrite or delete another's console integration (#9640)\n* Extend embedding-based classification to PRs (area labels) (#9004)\n* Title: Add RulesMCPServer to expose schema compatibility testing via MCP (#8986)\n* Unchecked generic varargs warning in AbstractCompatibilityChecker.unionOf (#8905)\n* Bug: ClassCastException in MCP Utils.toQueryLabels due to Object[] to String[] cast (#8727)\n\n"
}
